{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55277","headline":"偈 · 智晖","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有一间舍，父母爲修盖。\n住来八十年，近来觉损坏。\n早拟移住（《五灯会元》作「别」）处，事涉有憎爱。\n待他摧毁时，彼此无相碍。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十、《五灯会元》卷十三。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智晖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}